index 0000000..e0f059f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/pdf-converters-explicit-encoding-1bfe1d9e3fcffb83.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added an `encoding` init parameter to `PyPDFToDocument` and `PDFMinerToDocument`.
+    It defaults to `"utf-8"`, preserving previous behavior, but can be set to `"auto"`
+    to automatically detect and repair the encoding of the text extracted from a PDF,
+    or to any other codec name to explicitly re-decode it.
